<title>USA: Enron, Portland General okay revised merger.</title>
<headline>Enron, Portland General okay revised merger.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Corp said revised terms for its acquisition of Portland General Corp have been approved by directors of both companies.</p>
<p>The revision includes $141 million of merger-related benefits for Portland General's customers and reduces the number of shares Portland General holders will receive in the merger, Enron said in a statement.</p>
</text>
